
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#081326">
  <title>Staff Room | PALABOK COMMUNITY</title>

  <style>
    * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }

    body {
      min-height: 100vh;
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      background: #081326;
      color: #f4f7ff;
    }

    header {
      padding: 20px 6%;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 15px;
      background: #101e34;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #293e5d;
    }

    .brand { font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: 1px; }
    .brand span { color: #58b5ff; }

    header a {
      color: #9ecaff;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-size: 13px;
    }

    main {
      max-width: 1100px;
      margin: auto;
      padding: 42px 22px;
    }

    .eyebrow {
      color: #58b5ff;
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: bold;
      letter-spacing: 2px;
    }

    h1 { margin: 12px 0; font-size: 35px; }

    .intro {
      color: #9eacc2;
      font-size: 14px;
      line-height: 1.8;
      margin-bottom: 27px;
    }

    .security {
      padding: 17px;
      margin-bottom: 28px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,190,80,.3);
      border-radius: 12px;
      background: rgba(255,190,80,.07);
      color: #e8c98d;
      font-size: 12px;
      line-height: 1.7;
    }

    h2 { margin-bottom: 16px; font-size: 20px; }

    .grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr));
      gap: 17px;
    }

    .card {
      display: block;
      padding: 22px;
      min-height: 155px;
      border: 1px solid #293e5d;
      border-radius: 14px;
      background: #101e34;
      color: white;
      text-decoration: none;
      transition: .2s;
    }

    .card:hover {
      transform: translateY(-3px);
      border-color: #58b5ff;
    }

    .icon { font-size: 27px; margin-bottom: 15px; }
    .card h3 { margin-bottom: 9px; font-size: 16px; }

    .card p {
      color: #9eacc2;
      font-size: 12px;
      line-height: 1.7;
    }

    .role-info {
      margin-top: 28px;
      padding: 22px;
      border: 1px solid #293e5d;
      border-radius: 14px;
      background: #101e34;
    }

    .role-info p {
      color: #aab8cd;
      font-size: 13px;
      line-height: 1.8;
    }

    footer {
      margin-top: 40px;
      padding: 25px;
      text-align: center;
      border-top: 1px solid #263751;
      color: #71819a;
      font-size: 12px;
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>

  <header>
    <div class="brand">PALABOK <span>STAFF ROOM</span></div>
    <a href="dashboard.html">← Dashboard</a>
  </header>

  <main>

    <div class="eyebrow">AUTHORIZED TEAM WORKSPACE</div>
    <h1>Staff Room</h1>

    <p class="intro">
      Welcome to the staff workspace. Use the available
      tools responsibly to help manage and protect
      PALABOK COMMUNITY.
    </p>

    <div class="security">
      <strong>🔒 Restricted Area</strong><br>
      This page is only a visual template. Hiding this page
      from ordinary members is not sufficient security.
      Firebase Authentication and server-side permission
      checks must protect every staff action and private record.
    </div>

    <h2>Staff Tools</h2>

    <section class="grid">

      <a class="card" href="members.html">
        <div class="icon">👥</div>
        <h3>Member Directory</h3>
        <p>Review community member information and account records.</p>
      </a>

      <a class="card" href="tickets.html">
        <div class="icon">🎫</div>
        <h3>Support Tickets</h3>
        <p>Review member concerns and support requests.</p>
      </a>

      <a class="card" href="applications.html">
        <div class="icon">📝</div>
        <h3>Applications</h3>
        <p>View staff and creator application submissions.</p>
      </a>

      <a class="card" href="announcements.html">
        <div class="icon">📢</div>
        <h3>Announcements</h3>
        <p>View official community notices and updates.</p>
      </a>

      <a class="card" href="sneak-peeks.html">
        <div class="icon">👀</div>
        <h3>Sneak Peeks</h3>
        <p>View previews and upcoming community projects.</p>
      </a>

      <a class="card" href="staff-management.html">
        <div class="icon">🛡️</div>
        <h3>Staff Management</h3>
        <p>Restricted management area for authorized leadership.</p>
      </a>

      <a class="card" href="creator-management.html">
        <div class="icon">🎨</div>
        <h3>Creator Management</h3>
        <p>Review creator accounts and community projects.</p>
      </a>

    </section>

    <section class="role-info">
      <h2>Staff Permissions</h2>
      <p>
        Staff permissions should be assigned by authorized
        management. Moderation actions must be recorded in
        an audit log. Owner protection must be enforced by
        the backend, not by editable HTML or browser code.
      </p>
    </section>

  </main>

  <footer>
    © <span id="year"></span> PALABOK COMMUNITY
  </footer>

  <script>
    document.getElementById("year").textContent =
      new Date().getFullYear();

    /*
      BACKEND REQUIREMENTS:
      1. Verify Firebase user authentication.
      2. Fetch the user's trusted role from Firestore.
      3. Deny access unless the user has staff permissions.
      4. Enforce every moderation permission server-side.
      5. Record sensitive actions in an audit log.
    */
  </script>

</body>
</html>
